title: Social welfare policy
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs, cabinet
on-arrival: social_welfare_timer = 10; month_actions += 1
view-if: spd_in_government = 1 and social_welfare_timer = 0
card-image: img/portraits/ArendtWalter.jpg

= Social Welfare Policy

The social welfare program, including unemployment insurance, healthcare, and old-age care, is the proudest achievement of the <span style="color: #C00000;">**SPD**</span> in our time in government. There is continuous pressure to dismantle the welfare system.

- @reduce_spending: Reduce spending on welfare.
- @increase_spending: Increase spending on welfare.
- @spending_same: Keep spending the same.
- @easy_discard
#- @cancel_advisor_action

@reduce_spending
subtitle: This will hurt our proletarian base. +1 Budget
unavailable-subtitle: There is nothing left to cut.
choose-if: welfare >= -5
on-arrival: budget += 1; workers_spd -= 3; welfare -= 1; pragmatist_dissent += 5; new_left_dissent += 10; trade_unionist_dissent += 10; democratic_scoialist_dissent += 10; fdp_relation += 5; cdu_relation += 5; pro_republic -= 3; coalition_dissent -= 1 if (in_grand_coalition or in_social_liberal_coalition) and coalition_dissent > 0; inflation -= 0.3; economic_growth -= 0.2;

We have reduced levels of social welfare spending. This means more poverty and suffering for the working class. Our detractors claim that we are sacrificing proletarian livelihoods for the sake of class peace with the bourgeoisie. Are they wrong?


@increase_spending
view-if: unemployed <= 15
choose-if: budget > 0
subtitle: -1 Budget
on-arrival: budget -= 1; workers_spd += 0.7*(1-dissent); welfare += 1; pragmatist_dissent -= 5; trade_unionist_dissent -= 5; democratic_scoialist_dissent -= 5; new_left_dissent -= 5; coalition_dissent += 1 if welfare > 1; inflation += 0.3; economic_growth += 0.2;

We have increased welfare spending. Our proletarian base is pleased.


@spending_same

We have kept welfare spending the same.
